  "description": "The Mambo-E electric bike is designed to excel across various terrains, from city streets to light off-road trails, providing a comfortable and versatile riding experience. Equipped with a Motinova mid-drive motor delivering 65Nm of torque, a 504Wh integrated battery, and five levels of pedal assistance, the Mambo-E ensures smooth and efficient rides over long distances.\n\nIts robust alloy frame includes a convenient dropper post for on-the-fly saddle adjustments, and a WTB Volt saddle for optimal comfort, while a 10-speed Shimano gear system and Tektro hydraulic disc brakes enhance performance, making it suitable for diverse adventures.\n\nThe Suntour XCR32 suspension fork with 120mm of travel, lockout function, and Maxxis Ardent tires on 29” double-wall tubeless wheels further elevate the Mambo-E’s stability and traction.\n\nDropper Post: Featuring a handy dropper post that enables you to easily fine-tune your saddle height on the go\n\nThe Voodoo Mambo-E trekking bike complements the Voodoo mountain bike range, designed specifically with road and gravel in mind and for those longer trips instead of the typical bumpy and obstacle full mountain trails.",
